text gFameCheckerFlavorText_ProfOak0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}OAK POKéMON RESEARCH LAB$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_ProfOak1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}To make a complete guide on all\n"
    "the POKéMON in the world…\p"
    "That was my dream!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_ProfOak2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}PROF. OAK may not look like much,\n"
    "but he's the authority on POKéMON.\p"
    "Many POKéMON TRAINERS hold him in\n"
    "high regard.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_ProfOak3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}PROF. OAK reportedly lives with his\n"
    "grandchildren, DAISY and {RIVAL}.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_ProfOak4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I hear OAK's taken a lot of\n"
    "interest in you, child.\p"
    "That old duff was once tough and\n"
    "handsome.\p"
    "But that was decades ago.\n"
    "He's a shadow of his former self.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_ProfOak5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}PROF. OAK is going to have his own\n"
    "radio show soon.\p"
    "The program will be called PROF.\n"
    "OAK'S POKéMON SEMINAR.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Daisy0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}If you show DAISY your POKéMON,\n"
    "she can tell how much it likes you.\p"
    "Occasionally, she will even groom\n"
    "a POKéMON for you.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Daisy1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}But the person who is most liked by\n"
    "POKéMON is DAISY, I think.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Daisy2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}She was gently grooming POKéMON…\n"
    "She was a little angel.\p"
    "That little girl's name…\n"
    "I think it was DAISY.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Daisy3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}PROF. OAK reportedly lives with his\n"
    "grandchildren, DAISY and {RIVAL}.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Daisy4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}A girl from PALLET TOWN, DAISY,\n"
    "she enjoys TEA every day.\p"
    "She visits the CELADON DEPT. STORE\n"
    "to buy some TEA.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Daisy5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}The Spring POKéMON CONTEST's\n"
    "Grand Champion is DAISY OAK of\l"
    "PALLET TOWN!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Brock0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}PEWTER CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    "LEADER: BROCK\l"
    "The Rock-Solid POKéMON TRAINER!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Brock1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}My rock-hard willpower is evident\n"
    "in even my POKéMON.\p"
    "My POKéMON are all rock hard and\n"
    "have true-grit determination.\p"
    "That's right - my POKéMON are all\n"
    "the ROCK type!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Brock2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}There aren't many serious POKéMON\n"
    "TRAINERS here.\p"
    "They're all like BUG CATCHERS,\n"
    "you know, just hobbyists.\p"
    "But PEWTER GYM's BROCK isn't like\n"
    "that, not one bit.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Brock3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}BROCK is cool. He's not just tough.\n"
    "People like and respect him.\p"
    "I want to become a GYM LEADER\n"
    "like him.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Brock4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Hi, I'm excavating for fossils here\n"
    "under MT. MOON.\p"
    "Sometimes, BROCK of PEWTER GYM\n"
    "lends me a hand.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Brock5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}BROCK rarely laughs, but is said to\n"
    "be unable to stop if he starts.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Misty0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}CERULEAN CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    "LEADER: MISTY\l"
    "The Tomboyish Mermaid!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Misty1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}My policy is an all-out offensive\n"
    "with WATER-type POKéMON!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Misty2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}MISTY is a TRAINER who's going to\n"
    "keep improving.\p"
    "She won't lose to someone like you!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Misty3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Strong TRAINERS and WATER POKéMON\n"
    "are common sights in these parts.\p"
    "They say that MISTY of the\n"
    "CERULEAN GYM trains here.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Misty4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}This cape is a famous date spot.\p"
    "MISTY, the GYM LEADER, has high\n"
    "hopes about this place.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Misty5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}MISTY is said to worship LORELEI\n"
    "of the ELITE FOUR.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_LtSurge0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}VERMILION CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    "LEADER: LT. SURGE\l"
    "The Lightning American!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_LtSurge1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I tell you, kid, electric POKéMON\n"
    "saved me during the war!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_LtSurge2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}When I was in the Army, LT. SURGE\n"
    "was my strict CO.\p"
    "He was a hard taskmaster.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_LtSurge3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}LT. SURGE was always famous for\n"
    "his cautious nature in the Army.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_LtSurge4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}LT. SURGE installed the traps in\n"
    "the GYM himself.\p"
    "He set up double locks everywhere.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_LtSurge5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}LT. SURGE is rumored to have been\n"
    "a pilot while home in America.\p"
    "He used the electricity generated\n"
    "by POKéMON to power his plane.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Erika0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}CELADON CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    "LEADER: ERIKA\l"
    "The Nature-Loving Princess!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Erika1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I am a student of the art of\n"
    "flower arranging.\p"
    "My POKéMON are solely of the\n"
    "GRASS type.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Erika2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Our LEADER ERIKA might be quiet,\n"
    "but she's famous around here.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Erika3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}We only use GRASS-type POKéMON at\n"
    "our GYM.\p"
    "Why? We also use them for making\n"
    "flower arrangements!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Erika4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I would never collect POKéMON if\n"
    "they were unattractive.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Erika5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Rumor has it that if you peek into\n"
    "CELADON GYM, you can often\l"
    "see ERIKA snoozing.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Koga0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}FUCHSIA CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    "LEADER: KOGA\l"
    "The Poisonous Ninja Master$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Koga1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Despair to the creeping horror of\n"
    "POISON-type POKéMON!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Koga2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Even though I've lost, I will keep\n"
    "training according to the teachings\l"
    "of KOGA, my ninja master.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Koga3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}My father is the GYM LEADER of\n"
    "this town.\p"
    "I'm training to use POISON POKéMON\n"
    "as well as my father.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Koga4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}KOGA is said to have a thorough\n"
    "knowledge of medicine.\p"
    "He even concocts medicine to nurse\n"
    "his POKéMON to health.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Koga5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}The SAFARI ZONE's huge, wouldn't\n"
    "you say?\p"
    "FUCHSIA's GYM LEADER, KOGA, \n"
    "patrols the grounds every so often.\p"
    "Thanks to him, we can play here\n"
    "knowing that we're safe.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Sabrina0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}SAFFRON CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    "LEADER: SABRINA\l"
    "The Master of PSYCHIC POKéMON!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Sabrina1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}You know about a girl GYM LEADER\n"
    "in SAFFRON CITY?\p"
    "She uses PSYCHIC-type POKéMON,\n"
    "right?$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Sabrina2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I have had psychic powers since\n"
    "I was a child.\p"
    "It started when a spoon I\n"
    "carelessly tossed, bent.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Sabrina3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I dislike battling, but if you wish,\n"
    "I will show you my powers!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Sabrina4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}People say that SABRINA can\n"
    "communicate with her POKéMON\l"
    "during battle without speaking.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Sabrina5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}SABRINA just wiped out the KARATE\n"
    "MASTER next door.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Blaine0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}CINNABAR ISLAND POKéMON GYM\n"
    "LEADER: BLAINE\l"
    "The Hotheaded Quiz Master!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Blaine1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}My fiery POKéMON are all rough\n"
    "and ready with intense heat!\p"
    "They incinerate all challengers!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Blaine2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Our LEADER, BLAINE, became lost\n"
    "in the mountains but good.\p"
    "Night fell when a fiery bird\n"
    "POKéMON appeared.\p"
    "Its light allowed BLAINE to find\n"
    "his way down safely.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Blaine3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}CINNABAR GYM's BLAINE is quite the\n"
    "odd fellow.\p"
    "He's lived on the island since way\n"
    "before the LAB was built.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Blaine4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}It's a photo of BLAINE and\n"
    "MR. FUJI.\p"
    "They're standing shoulder to\n"
    "shoulder with big grins.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Blaine5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}BLAINE is said to remove his dark\n"
    "shades only when he is thinking up\l"
    "new quiz questions.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lorelei0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I am LORELEI of the ELITE FOUR.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lorelei1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}No one can best me when it comes\n"
    "to icy POKéMON.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lorelei2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Where was this person born?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}We've had a great and powerful\n"
    "TRAINER grow up on this island.\p"
    "I bet even you'd know her.\n"
    "It's LORELEI of the ELITE FOUR!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lorelei3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Known for her logical, calculated,\n"
    "and cool battling style, LORELEI\l"
    "has a surprising secret!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lorelei4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Did you know that LORELEI has lots\n"
    "and lots of stuffed dolls?\p"
    "Every time she comes back to\n"
    "FOUR ISLAND, her collection grows!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lorelei5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}The LAPRAS she has, I imagine it\n"
    "to be the one she met as a child.\p"
    "I believe it was in ICEFALL CAVE\n"
    "that she caught it.\p"
    "Perhaps that POKéMON has been with\n"
    "her ever since.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bruno0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I am BRUNO of the ELITE FOUR!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bruno1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I've lived and trained with my\n"
    "fighting POKéMON!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bruno2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}BRUNO apparently joined the ELITE\n"
    "FOUR out of his burning ambition to\l"
    "battle the best TRAINERS.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bruno3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}BRUNO, who's a senior ahead of me,\n"
    "visits the SPA on occasion.\p"
    "He comes to rehab injuries, both\n"
    "his own and his POKéMON's.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bruno4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}He's one of the ELITE FOUR.\n"
    "His name is BRUNO.\p"
    "He went away disappointed when he\n"
    "found out that they were all sold\l"
    "out of Rage Candybars.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bruno5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Even BRUNO…\n"
    "He trained with a fellow by the\l"
    "name of BRAWLY before.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Agatha0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I am AGATHA of the ELITE FOUR.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Agatha1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}AGATHA's GHOST-type POKéMON are\n"
    "horrifically terrifying in toughness.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Agatha2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}That old lady's also got a really\n"
    "short fuse, too.\p"
    "It doesn't take anything to get\n"
    "that scary lady hollering.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Agatha3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}In her youth, AGATHA and PROF.\n"
    "OAK were rivals who vied for\l"
    "supremacy as TRAINERS.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Agatha4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I hear OAK's taken a lot of\n"
    "interest in you, child.\p"
    "That old duff was once tough and\n"
    "handsome.\p"
    "But that was decades ago.\n"
    "He's a shadow of his former self.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Agatha5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Take AGATHA, for example.\p"
    "She set a record for being the\n"
    "oldest-ever ELITE FOUR member.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lance0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I lead the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    "You can call me LANCE the dragon\n"
    "TRAINER.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lance1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}You know that dragons are\n"
    "mythical POKéMON.\p"
    "They're hard to catch and raise,\n"
    "but their powers are superior.\p"
    "They're virtually indestructible.\n"
    "There's no being clever with them.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lance2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}He stands for justice!\n"
    "He's cool, and yet passionate!\l"
    "He's the greatest, LANCE!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lance3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}We have a customer, LANCE, who\n"
    "occasionally comes.\p"
    "He always buys capes.\p"
    "I wonder… Does he have many\n"
    "identical capes at home?$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lance4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}LANCE's grandfather is thought to\n"
    "be the elder of a famous clan of\l"
    "dragon masters.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Lance5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}From what I've heard, LANCE has\n"
    "a cousin who's a GYM LEADER\l"
    "somewhere far away.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bill0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}After all, BILL's world-famous as a\n"
    "POKéMANIAC.\p"
    "He invented the POKéMON Storage\n"
    "System on PC, too.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bill1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}BILL has lots of POKéMON!\n"
    "He collects rare ones, too!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bill2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}He's my grandson!\p"
    "He always liked collecting things,\n"
    "even as a child!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bill3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}BILL is a POKéMANIAC, so he loves\n"
    "every kind.\p"
    "Apparently, the first one he caught\n"
    "was an ABRA.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bill4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}BILL's hometown is GOLDENROD CITY,\n"
    "where his folks still live.\p"
    "I've heard that it's quite the\n"
    "festive, bustling city.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Bill5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Apparently, BILL simply can't\n"
    "stomach milk at all.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_MrFuji0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}He's really kind.\p"
    "He looks after abandoned and\n"
    "orphaned POKéMON.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_MrFuji1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}This old guy marched right up to\n"
    "our HIDEOUT.\p"
    "Then, he starts ranting about how\n"
    "TEAM ROCKET's abusing POKéMON.\p"
    "So, we're just talking it over as\n"
    "adults.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_MrFuji2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}POKéMON FAN MAGAZINE\n"
    "Monthly Grand Prize Drawing!\p"
    "The application form is…\p"
    "Gone! It's been clipped out.\n"
    "Someone must have applied already.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_MrFuji3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I hear that MR. FUJI's not from\n"
    "these parts originally, either.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_MrFuji4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}It's a photo of BLAINE and\n"
    "MR. FUJI.\p"
    "They're standing shoulder to\n"
    "shoulder with big grins.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_MrFuji5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Editor: The shy MR. FUJI turned\n"
    "down our interview requests.\p"
    "He is a kindly man who is adored\n"
    "and respected in LAVENDER TOWN.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Giovanni0 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}TEAM ROCKET captures POKéMON from\n"
    "around the world.\p"
    "They're important tools for keeping\n"
    "our criminal enterprise going.\p"
    "I am the leader, GIOVANNI!$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Giovanni1 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of POKéMON?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Those thugs that took over our\n"
    "building…\p"
    "Their BOSS said he was looking for\n"
    "strong POKéMON.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Giovanni2 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}TEAM ROCKET's BOSS is terribly\n"
    "cruel!\p"
    "To him, POKéMON are just tools to\n"
    "be used.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Giovanni3 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Welcome to my hideout!\p"
    "It shall be so until I can restore\n"
    "TEAM ROCKET to its former glory.$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Giovanni4 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Blow me away! GIOVANNI was the\n"
    "GYM LEADER of VIRIDIAN?$"
}

text gFameCheckerFlavorText_Giovanni5 {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Family and friends?\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}You… You're not GIOVANNI's kid,\n"
    "are you?\p"
    "No, that can't be right.\n"
    "GIOVANNI's kid has red hair.$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_ProfOak {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}PROF. OAK$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_ProfOak {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: PROF. OAK\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Why do POKéMON compete and battle\n"
    "so hard for you?\p"
    "They do so because they can see\n"
    "the love and trust you have\l"
    "towards POKéMON.\p"
    "Never forget that.$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Daisy {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}DAISY$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Daisy {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: DAISY\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}While I was comfortably enjoying\n"
    "my tea breaks, you've grown very\l"
    "skilled and powerful.\p"
    "I hope you'll remain a good rival\n"
    "to my little brother.$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Brock {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}BROCK$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Brock {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: BROCK\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}In this big world of ours, there\n"
    "must be many tough TRAINERS.\p"
    "Let's both keep training and\n"
    "making ourselves stronger!$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Misty {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}MISTY$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Misty {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: MISTY\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I'm going to keep training here at\n"
    "this GYM.\p"
    "When I get better, I'd love to hit\n"
    "the road and travel.$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_LtSurge {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}LT. SURGE$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_LtSurge {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: LT. SURGE\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Hey, kid!\n"
    "You electrified me in our battle!\p"
    "I didn't know that there were\n"
    "gutsy TRAINERS like you.\p"
    "It made me change my mind about\n"
    "you!$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Erika {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}ERIKA$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Erika {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: ERIKA\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I am so glad that there are strong\n"
    "TRAINERS like you.\p"
    "That awareness alone inspires and\n"
    "motivates me to try harder.\p"
    "Please visit me again.\n"
    "Zzz…$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Koga {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}KOGA$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Koga {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: KOGA\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}You and I, we must both set our\n"
    "sights higher and work towards\l"
    "meeting our challenges.\p"
    "Now, I must go train my daughter.$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Sabrina {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}SABRINA$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Sabrina {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: SABRINA\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}The love you have towards your\n"
    "POKéMON…\p"
    "It was a power that was never\n"
    "bested by my psychic power.$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Blaine {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}BLAINE$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Blaine {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: BLAINE\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}My fire POKéMON!\n"
    "They'll become even more powerful!\p"
    "And now, a quiz. How many kinds of\n"
    "FIRE-type POKéMON are there?$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Lorelei {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}LORELEI$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Lorelei {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: LORELEI\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I needed to thank you for your\n"
    "help.\p"
    "But that has nothing to do with our\n"
    "battles.\p"
    "You'd better watch out next time!$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Bruno {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}BRUNO$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Bruno {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: BRUNO\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}The super power of your POKéMON\n"
    "and you I've experienced myself.\p"
    "Next time, maybe I should show you\n"
    "how to train yourself.$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Agatha {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}AGATHA$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Agatha {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: AGATHA\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}When you grow older, don't you\n"
    "dare go soft like that coot OAK!\p"
    "Be like me and keep battling on!$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Lance {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}LANCE$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Lance {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: LANCE\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I'm considering going back to my\n"
    "hometown.\p"
    "I want to retrain my DRAGON-type\n"
    "POKéMON and strengthen them.\p"
    "I'd like to invite you to my\n"
    "hometown one day.$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Bill {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}BILL$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Bill {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: BILL\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Hey, there! CELIO had nothing but\n"
    "praise for you.\p"
    "Hearing that makes me happy.\p"
    "When you catch some rare POKéMON,\n"
    "come show me, okay? Promise!$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_MrFuji {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}MR. FUJI$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_MrFuji {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: MR. FUJI\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Instead of hoping for the happiness\n"
    "of just your POKéMON…\p"
    "…Can I get you to wish for the\n"
    "happiness of all POKéMON?$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonName_Giovanni {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}GIOVANNI$"
}

text gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Giovanni {
    "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: GIOVANNI\n"
    "To: {PLAYER}\p"
    "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}There is nothing that I wish to say\n"
    "to you.\p"
    "I will concentrate solely on\n"
    "bettering myself, and none other.$"
}

